# Remember to never publicly share your keystore.
# See https://flutter.dev/to/reference-keystore
key.properties
**/*.keystore
**/*.jks
# Exception: shared-debug.keystore is intentionally committed — a fixed,
# public-password debug-only keystore shared by the whole team so every
# machine/emulator produces the same SHA-1 and never needs re-whitelisting
# in Google Cloud Console. It cannot sign a Play Store release.
!app/shared-debug.keystore
